{"id":"n38208-1-7","stage":4,"title":"꽁꽁 · 坚硬地","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n38208-1-7-1","ko":"너무 추워서 손이 꽁꽁 어는 것 같아.","zh":"太冷了，手好像都冻僵了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太。","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"추워서","meaning":"冷","explanation":"춥다：冷；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"춥다","audio":"/audio/7c651efb56d12a6540a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72146","senseId":"1","lemma":"춥다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"추워서","audio":"/audio/0b67ec971d5347edda2f.mp3"}},{"text":"손이","meaning":"手","explanation":"손：手；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"손","audio":"/audio/27d4fa6af704520dcfd6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17608","senseId":"1","lemma":"손","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"손이","audio":"/audio/7bcb7cea5b6e3bb592ca.mp3"}},{"text":"꽁꽁","meaning":"坚硬地，硬实地，硬邦邦地","explanation":"꽁꽁：坚硬地，硬实地，硬邦邦地。","readings":[{"term":"꽁꽁","audio":"/audio/5e59b23064fb27d12e74.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38208","senseId":"1","lemma":"꽁꽁","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꽁꽁","audio":"/audio/5e59b23064fb27d12e74.mp3"}},{"text":"어는","meaning":"冻僵","explanation":"얼다：冻僵；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"얼다","audio":"/audio/483a31bad3d8768e32a5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66572","senseId":"2","lemma":"얼다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어는","audio":"/audio/23d96f29b7945b295f92.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surf