"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내일부터는","audio":"/audio/8d682863cbb926d9d7fe.mp3"}},{"text":"따뜻하게","meaning":"暖和","explanation":"따뜻하다：暖和；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"따뜻하다","audio":"/audio/e4840ad0903352f1e2e3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57297","senseId":"1","lemma":"따뜻하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"따뜻하게","audio":"/audio/c0681214abc6da5f51e0.mp3"}},{"text":"장갑을","meaning":"手套","explanation":"장갑：手套；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"장갑","audio":"/audio/bb003394f5f694deb9ea.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24764","senseId":"1","lemma":"장갑","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"장갑을","audio":"/audio/5e63b2a60c7aa5ce58f9.mp3"}},{"text":"끼고","meaning":"插，夹，掖","explanation":"끼다：插，夹，掖；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"끼다","audio":"/audio/62c9da6515c8237ff0f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61097","senseId":"1","lemma":"끼다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"끼고","audio":"/audio/9f3112402d255d7d87e7.mp3"}},{"text":"다녀.","meaning":"常去","explanation":"다니다：常去；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"다니다","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29702","senseId":"1","lemma":"다니다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다녀","audio":"/audio/e3a1a0dcaf78067a8719.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1e07b94ba5182a41","term":"내일","zh":"明天，明日","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3","entryId":"30193","definition":"今天的下一天。","pronunciation":["내일"]},{"id":"e4840ad0903352f1","term":"따뜻하다","zh":"暖和","audio":"/audio/e4840ad0903352f1e2e3.mp3","entryId":"57297","definition":"温度适中，不觉得太热，达到心情舒适的程度。","pronunciation":["따뜨타다"]},{"id":"bb003394f5f694de","term":"장갑","zh":"手套","audio":"/audio/bb003394f5f694deb9ea.mp3","entryId":"24764","definition":"用布、线、皮等制成的戴在手上用来保护手或防寒的物品。","pronunciation":["장ː갑"]},{"id":"62c9da6515c8237f","term":"끼다","zh":"插，夹，掖","audio":"/audio/62c9da6515c8237ff0f1.mp3",